                      "type": "math",
                      "latex": "\\begin{aligned}16^{\\frac{5}{4}}&=(16^5)^{\\frac{1}{4}}=(1\\,048\\,576)^{\\frac{1}{4}}\\\\&=\\sqrt[4]{1\\,048\\,576}=32\\end{aligned}",
